	(text "Cmin = (Iout * D * (1-D) * 1000) / fsw * Vp(max)\n\nD = 0.9167\n\nIout = 3A, fsw = 300kHz, Vp = 75mV, dc = 0.1042\n\nCmin = (3 * 0.9167 * (1-0.9167) * 1000) / 300 * 0.075\nCmin = 10.18uF\n\nUse 2x10uF to reduce ESL. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 192.024 184.912 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c51b0b4f-3efa-44dc-ae83-2f5b3f29e2e3")
	)
	(text "I = Ia + Id = 31mA / ch\nSafety margin of 1.35 ~ 42mA / ch\n\nFor two channels, Imax = 86mA\n\nTarget low DCR, ~30-50moHm\n\nfsw = 2MHz, should be attentuated by 40dB \nA (dB) = 40log(fsw/fc) >= 40 dB (2nd order LC filter)\nfc <= 200 kHz, but also well above 20H-20kHz audio band, (100k-200kHz)\n\nTarget 130kHz\n\nfix C to 10uF + 100nF, with Ceff ~= 6uF @ 5V\n\nL = 1 / (2pifc)^2 * Ceff =~ 0.25 uH\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 378.206 230.378 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c71c4f42-bbd6-4255-b354-ba67c4b256ad")
	)
	(text "Rshunt < Vsense_max / Imax (ADCRANGE bit = 1)\nRshunt < 81.92mV / 80mA = 1ohm\n\n"
